{"id": "34036", "title": "暴君的玩物", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 38, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34036.htm", "intro": "父亲的见义勇为，为陶涓婈换来个豪门新娘的身分，但她明白自己永远不可能，高攀成为少爷的妻。能离开叶家，或许是最好的结果——八年后再度相见，她已是夜市有名的「煎包西施」，而他……竟打算履行，两家当年的约定?! 都已经什么时代了，还有人拿婚事报恩?! 对于父亲为他定下的新娘，叶定彻心里只有厌恶，瞧那女孩的穷酸样，充其量只配当他家的女佣！ 想不到几年没见，她出落得如此甜美可人—— 虽然从没打算要娶她，不过留她在身边当玩物，似乎是个不错的主意……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34036", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2164732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2164733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2164734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2164735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2164736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2164737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2164738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2164739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2164740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2164741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2164742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2164743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2164744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2164745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2164746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2164747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2164748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2164749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2164750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2164751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2164752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2164753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2164754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2164755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2164756.html"